# 🇧🇷 Brazilian Portuguese Linguistic Evaluation

## Overview

This repository demonstrates my work in evaluating Brazilian Portuguese for Large Language Models (LLMs), with a focus on linguistic quality, semantic accuracy, contextual understanding, and natural language evaluation.

The goal is to assess AI-generated responses beyond grammar, measuring whether the language is accurate, natural, contextually appropriate, and aligned with native Brazilian Portuguese usage.

